WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.705 --> 00:00:07.553
The desk is where your agents ask you things: questions, approvals and heads-ups. Answer them, and the work moves on.

2
00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:13.335
Open Desk in the sidebar. The number next to it shows how many items are waiting for you.

3
00:00:14.036 --> 00:00:21.631
Items are grouped by what needs you most: Needs you first at the top, then heads-ups, and the decisions your CEO took at the end.

4
00:00:22.335 --> 00:00:29.055
The chips filter the list. Blocking shows only what holds up cards. Questions and Approvals show one kind each.

5
00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:31.941
All brings everything back.

6
00:00:32.645 --> 00:00:38.384
Each question says who asked, what they were doing, and the options. Pick one, or type your own answer.

7
00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:47.659
Add to ledger as decides how your answer is kept. A standing order for this project means agents follow it from now on, without asking again.

8
00:00:48.373 --> 00:00:54.218
Your CEO reads the desk too. Here it recommends an answer, with its reason and how sure it is.

9
00:00:54.918 --> 00:00:59.419
If you agree, choose Accept recommendation, and the answer goes out at once.

10
00:01:00.124 --> 00:01:06.204
Handled by CEO shows what your CEO settled on its own, also the items you have already reviewed.

11
00:01:06.904 --> 00:01:16.611
CEO decisions lists the ones still waiting for your review: what was asked, what it decided and why. Acknowledge it, or correct it so the CEO learns.

12
00:01:17.323 --> 00:01:27.840
Every morning the CEO leaves a Daily report: what needs you, and everything it decided or recommended in the last 24 hours, with a Correct button on each decision.

13
00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:33.276
That is the desk. Visit it once or twice a day, and your agents never wait long.
